Z||000000||Tabs||08-14-2001||05:02 PM||||Does anybody know were I can get clear blinker lights front and sides plus clear reflecters that go in2 the bumpers 4 a fiero???<P>Tabs||||reg||1
Z||000001||Nashco||08-14-2001||06:24 PM||||I don't think I've seen any clear lights for the fiero, but with a little ingenuity you can make your own custom lights.  I have a friend with a Beretta that made some Altezza style lights out of stock taillight housings/covers, and some trailer/tractor lights.  I laughed my ass off when I first heard him say that, but when I finally got to see them, they really weren't bad.  I know I'm probably starting a horrible thing, but his looked good, cost about 20 bucks total, and weren't available through any aftermarket companies, so it was good overall.  Good luck, and if you find some aftermarket lights for the fiero, let us know!<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
